{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"10419","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10419","key":"MC-72687","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"04/Oct/14 11:42 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"TheBug%3A\"></a><b>The Bug:</b></h3>\n\n<p>There are no shadows on text displayed within the action bar.</p>\n\n<p>This is an issue because the text can be quite difficult to read, so having a shadow displayed on all text within the action bar would resolve this problem.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"StepstoReproduce%3A\"></a><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b></h3>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Display some text on the action bar and look at it closely.</li>\n\t<li><div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/title @a actionbar {<span class=\"code-quote\">\"text\"</span>:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"MC-72687\"</span>,<span class=\"code-quote\">\"color\"</span>:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"white\"</span>}</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Take note as to whether or not there are any shadows on text displayed within the action bar.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"ObservedBehavior%3A\"></a><b>Observed Behavior:</b></h3>\n\n<p>There are no shadows on text displayed within the action bar.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"ExpectedBehavior%3A\"></a><b>Expected Behavior:</b></h3>\n\n<p>There would be shadows on text displayed within the action bar.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"CodeAnalysis%3A\"></a><b>Code Analysis:</b></h3>\n\n<p>Code analysis by <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=haykam\" rel=\"noreferrer\">haykam</a> can be found in <a href=\"https://bugs.mojang.com/browse/MC-72687?focusedCommentId=1169179&amp;page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels%3Acomment-tabpanel#comment-1169179\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">this comment</a>.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"15/Oct/16 9:48 AM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/11053","id":"11053","filename":"Capture d’écran 2014-10-04 à 20.36.20.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png"},"displayName":"migrated","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"04/Oct/14 11:42 AM","size":"12 kB","mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/11053","thumbnail":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/11053"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/11054","id":"11054","filename":"javaw 2016-10-15 11-09-21-800.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","16x16":"ht